    fix(api): document /metrics + import 409 codes in OpenAPI spec and README — spec surface now matches mux. Addresses REVIEW-OB-015, REVIEW-OB-017, REVIEW-OB-018.
    
    REVIEW-OB-015: GET /metrics was registered on the mux (internal/api/server.go:118) but absent from pkg/api/openapi.yaml, which served 15 path keys. Added the /metrics path (operationId getMetrics, tags [stats], matching /health and /openapi.json) with both real response arms — 200 MetricsSnapshot and 404 Error for metrics_disabled when Observer is nil — plus a MetricsSnapshot component schema copied field-for-field from internal/metrics Snapshot/SolveRecord/HostSnapshot JSON tags. Note: Snapshot() does NOT include a recent slice (metrics.go comment: the bounded recent list is not part of the snapshot); only last_solve, last_host and last_skip_reason are omitempty, and the schema description says so. TestOpenAPISpec_AllEndpointsDocumented required-list extended with /metrics.
    
    REVIEW-OB-017: README architecture table said the HTTP server surface is 15 endpoints, a hand-written count that drifts with every route. Dropped it in favor of a pointer to /openapi.json as the authoritative endpoint list; the /metrics row in the README endpoints table (line 170) is untouched.
    
    REVIEW-OB-018: handleImport emits HTTP 409 with import_dest_not_empty (destination holds a non-empty answer set for this class) and source_repo_mismatch (existing shared clone origin differs from source_repo), but neither the docs nor the spec documented 409. docs/api-reference.md import section now documents both codes with trigger conditions and resolution; pkg/api/openapi.yaml gained a 409 arm on /api/v1/import with the same Error schema, and TestOpenAPISpec_ErrorResponsesDocumented now pins the exact set 200/400/409/500/501, keeping docs == spec.
    
    Verified before: 15 spec paths, import codes undocumented, README said 15 endpoints. Verified after: spec serves 16 paths with /metrics + MetricsSnapshot; live probe on a scratch instance (port 18711, fresh /tmp DB) returned 200 from /metrics with a shape matching the new schema; all three target test packages pass with -count=1.
    
    Co-authored-by: Alexis Okuwa <wojonstech@gmail.com>
